.env
node_modules/
dist/
*.db*
*.sqlite
.expo/

# Firebase service account keys. `google-services.json` is deliberately NOT
# here: it is client config that ships inside every APK anyway, and the build
# needs it. An *-adminsdk-* key is the opposite -- it can send push as the
# whole project, and belongs only in Expo's credential store.
*-firebase-adminsdk-*.json
